        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>笔记 - 第九章 无讼 / 第十章 无为政治</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #eee;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 750px;\n    background-color: #fdfdfa;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(150,180,190,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(150,180,190,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 18px 18px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    font-family: \"Segoe Script\", \"STXingkai\", \"KaiTi\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    padding: 20px 15px 20px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* binder holes on right edge */\n  .holes {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 6px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 14px;\n  }\n  .hole {\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #eee;\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n  }\n  .label-beizhu {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", cursive, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .label-zongjie {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", cursive, sans-serif;\n  }\n  h1.chapter {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .bullet-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 10px 0 14px 4px;\n  }\n  .tag-icon {\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 16px;\n    background: #7a8a7a;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .bullet-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    background-color: #f7f08a;\n  }\n  .plain-line {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 8px 0 8px 2px;\n  }\n  .sub-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 10px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .num-icon {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    background: #7a8a7a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 14px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .sub-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .note-top {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 250px;\n    right: 90px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    font-style: normal;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"holes\">\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top:70px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top:250px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top:430px;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\" style=\"top:610px;\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"label-beizhu\">备注:</div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"chapter\">第九章·无讼</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"bullet-block\">\n    <div class=\"tag-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bullet-text\">\n      \"讼师\"向\"律师\"的转变 改变 意味着\n      <span class=\"highlight\">礼治社会向法治</span><br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">社会的转变.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bullet-block\">\n    <div class=\"tag-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bullet-text\">\n      当社会结构和思想观念未能适应法治的时候，贸然<br>\n      推行法治下乡，一方面会破坏原有的礼治秩序，另一方<br>\n      面还不能建立起有效的法治秩序，使人们对\"法治\"<br>\n      产生抵触。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"chapter\" style=\"margin-top:30px;\">第十章·无为政治</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"note-top\">长期</div>\n\n  <div class=\"bullet-block\">\n    <div class=\"tag-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bullet-text\">\n      皇权(横暴权力)受受到小农经济的限制，无法进行大规<br>\n      模工程，所以会采用\"无为\"的方式来养民。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"plain-line\">二 研究权力主要从两方面看眼.</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-block\">\n    <div class=\"num-icon\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"sub-text\">\n      社会冲突⇒横暴权力: 在上下有别的权力统治下，人们达到了休戚<br>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;状态中的临时平衡，但这仅是冲突的调停.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-block\">\n    <div class=\"num-icon\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"sub-text\">\n      社会合作⇒同意权力: 每个人为了维持自己的生存状态，不得不做<br>\n      好自己的分内工作，同时也不视别人依赖他们分内的工作，这<br>\n      就产生了权利和义务.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"label-zongjie\">总结:</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
